        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Treaty of Trianon\n- Organizations: Sixty-Four Counties Youth Movement\n- Places: Hungary, Kolozsvár Ghetto\n- Topics: Hungarian territorial revisionism\n\nFacts:\n- The 1920 Treaty of Trianon made Hungary a landlocked state.\n- The Kolozsvár Ghetto was located in territory that had belonged to Hungary before the Treaty of Trianon.\n- The Sixty-Four Counties Youth Movement advocated revision of the Treaty of Trianon.",
